---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/baselayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About EGCS - Elite Global Cleaning Services">
  <main class="bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 via-white to-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-20 space-y-16">
      <!-- Hero / Intro -->
      <section class="text-center space-y-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-yellow-600 uppercase  py-10">
          About EGCS
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
          A smaller company by choice. A higher standard by design.
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We started EGCS because after years in this industry, we knew it could be done better. 
          Not just faster or cheaper — but with more honesty, more care, and more accountability 
          than most companies bother with.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Founder -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr,1.2fr] gap-10 md:gap-12 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Founder: <span class="text-yellow-600">Olga Burbano</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Olga Burbano spent years working inside this industry before she decided to build something of her own. 
            She'd seen how these jobs were handled — the cut corners, the vague timelines, the clients left confused 
            about what was actually done in their building. She knew she could do better. So she did.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            EGCS is the result of that decision — a company small enough to actually care about every client, 
            and experienced enough to handle what most can't.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white/70 shadow-sm px-6 py-6 md:px-8 md:py-20">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-500 uppercase mb-3">
            What drives us
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Every project we take on impacts real people — families, students, staff, and workers who need their 
            spaces to be safe. That responsibility is never “just another job” to us. It’s the reason we show up 
            the way we do.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Who We Work With -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          Who We Work With
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Our clients are school administrators responsible for the safety of hundreds of kids. 
          Property managers juggling a dozen buildings and a compliance deadline. Homeowners who just got 
          news they weren't expecting. Industrial facility owners who need the job done right the first time.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          What they all have in common: they need someone they can trust to handle something serious — and they 
          don't have room for mistakes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- What We Promise -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-yellow-100 bg-yellow-50/70 px-6 py-6 md:px-8 md:py-7">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
            What We Promise
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            When you work with EGCS, you're not getting handed off to a crew you've never met. 
            You get Burbano's team, her standards, and her direct involvement. You'll know what's happening, 
            why it's happening, and what comes next. That's not a sales pitch — that's just how we operate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-2">
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base">
            If you need a partner who treats your building — and the people in it — like their own, 
            we'd be honored to work with you.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/quote"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm md:text-base p-2  rounded-full shadow-md transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Get a Quote
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>